### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### 2. 🌈 Rainbow / Preparation (NNN)
### Opcode: 0x27 [01] — آماده‌سازی نودها
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════

PUT http://127.0.0.1:9001/api/nodes/set
Authorization: Bearer RBUS-TEST-TOKEN-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Game":    "Hide",
  "Bridge":  1,
  "General": "NNN"
}

### ─── پاسخ ───────────────────────────────────
# HTTP/1.1 200 OK
# {
#   "statusCode": 200,
#   "message": "success",
#   "ok": true,
#   "applied": {
#     "ok": true,
#     "game": "Hide",
#     "bridges": ["Bridge-1"],
#     "results": [
#       {
#         "ok": true,
#         "field": "General",
#         "bridge": "Bridge-1"
#       }
#     ]
#   }
# }

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### 3. 🔢 Display Number — نمایش عدد روی نود
### Opcode: 0x50
### فرمت: R{c}{o}{t}{p}
###   c : color     — 1=Blue 2=Yellow 3=Pink 4=Orange 5=White
###   o : ones      — رقم یکان  (0-9)
###   t : tens      — رقم دهگان (0-9)
###   p : checksum  — chr( ord(c) + ord(o) + ord(t) - 128 )
###
### ⚠️  فیلد key وجود ندارد — نود از طریق Arm مشخص می‌شود
###
### مثال زیر: color=Blue(1), عدد=23 → ones=3, tens=2
###   p = chr(49+51+50-128) = chr(22) = \u0016
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
PUT http://127.0.0.1:9001/api/nodes/set
Authorization: Bearer RBUS-TEST-TOKEN-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Game":    "Hide",
  "Bridge":  1,
  "General": "R\u0031\u0033\u0032\u0016",
  "key":     0,
  "addr":    0
}






### ─── پاسخ ───────────────────────────────────
# HTTP/1.1 200 OK

# {
#   "statusCode": 200,
#   "message": "success",
#   "ok": true,
#   "applied": {
#     "ok": true,
#     "game": "Hide",
#     "bridges": [
#       "Bridge-1"
#     ],
#     "results": [
#       {
#         "ok": true,
#         "bridge": "Bridge-1",
#         "opcode": "0x50",
#         "payload": "000000ff0203",
#         "field": "General"
#       }
#     ]
#   }
# }



### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### 4. ⏱️ Arm — آماده کردن نود برای بازی
### Opcode: 0x51
### پارامترها:
###   key   : شماره نود (0-11)
###   color : 1=Blue 2=Yellow 3=Pink 4=Orange 5=White
###   sec   : زمان (ثانیه)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════

PUT http://127.0.0.1:9001/api/nodes/set
Authorization: Bearer RBUS-TEST-TOKEN-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Game":    "Hide",
  "Bridge":  1,
  "General": "R\u0031\u0033\u0032\u0016",
  "key":     1
}

### ─── پاسخ ───────────────────────────────────
# HTTP/1.1 200 OK
# {
#   "statusCode": 200,
#   "message": "success",
#   "ok": true,
#   "applied": {
#     "ok": true,
#     "game": "Hide",
#     "bridges": ["Bridge-1"],
#     "results": [
#       {
#         "ok": true,
#         "field": "Arm",
#         "bridge": "Bridge-1",
#         "nodes": [1]
#       }
#     ]
#   }
# }


